br /\u003e- Tương thích tốt với tất cả các điện thoại / tablet / Laptop từ Android, iOS cho đến Windows/ MAc OS,\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMô Tả Sản Phẩm:\u003cbr /\u003e• Thương hiệu: Baseus\u003cbr /\u003e• Model: H06\u003cbr /\u003e• Phím chức năng: Mic thoại, Nghe/nhận cuộc gọi, Phát/dừng chơi nhạc, Tăng/giảm âm lượng\u003cbr /\u003e• Độ nhạy: 105 ± 3dB\u003cbr /\u003e• Loại Jack cắm: 3.5 mm\u003cbr /\u003e• Chiều dài dây: 1.2 m\u003cbr /\u003e• Màu sắc: Đen, Trắng\u003cbr /\u003e• Kiểu tai nghe: Có dây / Nhét tai (In-ear)\u003cbr /\u003e• Dải tần âm: 20 – 20,000Hz\u003cbr /\u003e• Trọng lượng: 14g\u003cbr /\u003eHình Ảnh:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg id=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/0e/c2/8d/4614a375da11e8562a2be078b517c859.jpg\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/0e/c2/8d/4614a375da11e8562a2be078b517c859.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg id=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/42/23/a2/3814d7cce46b9cbbb9be90da30be3bf5.jpg\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/42/23/a2/3814d7cce46b9cbbb9be90da30be3bf5.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg id=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/7f/54/07/df482d1960d45d8c8b8714b8067f4ece.jpg\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/7f/54/07/df482d1960d45d8c8b8714b8067f4ece.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg id=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/3f/dd/94/8c202b314629c4789a1f6519c0520929.jpg\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/3f/dd/94/8c202b314629c4789a1f6519c0520929.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg id=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/ca/4e/9f/2b7c73662f4b682df5f7fb8de776a257.jpg\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/ca/4e/9f/2b7c73662f4b682df5f7fb8de776a257.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003